ris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiscris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiscris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiscris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiscris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiscris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiscris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiscris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiscris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiscris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T18:58:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:01:46Z","body":"OK, I hope this one is a bit clearer.\r\nSome context:\r\nImagine this scenario - in a parent node you run:\r\n```\r\nvar my_children = get_children()\r\nfor child :Label in my_children:\r\n    print(child.text)\r\n```\r\nIf you have a situation where the first child is a Label, but the second one is not - you end up with a not very informative error message on the wrong line.\r\nIn #120821 I address that, but I noticed another problem - without the changes in this PR, the information about `child` value (the loop variable), and `@counter_pos` and `@container_pos` (the so called \"internal\" or \"compiler-generated\" variables) is not shown. The reason for that is because of how the member-variables are counted as part of a code block.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1584\" height=\"986\" alt=\"for_loop\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0dec14f8-bd36-495f-826e-d59c87c50124\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI wrongly called the loop variable and the internal counters variables \"loop iterators\". Corrected now","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4896576001/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]